00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:57.750
Once it's safer outside, we'll bring you
information about the on-going situation.

00:00:58.900 --> 00:00:59.960
That's all?

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:01.700
Why aren't they saying more?

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:03.450
Because they're afraid of causing panic.

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:04.960
