00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:11.820
Fear leads to chaos, chaos leads to anarchy.{anarchy leads to hatred, and hatred leads to the dark side.}{Weeaboo Editor's note: Somehow, I knew the other comment on this line would be a Star Wars joke before I looked at it.}

